  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">• <strong><u>Brand introduction:&nbsp;</u></strong>&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Sivi Comics is a rising digital publishing brand that blends bold storytelling with a cinematic edge</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"746\" id=\"isPasted\"><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">.</span></strong></span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;We create original, dark, and emotionally gripping eBooks across genres like sci-fi, horror, mystery, and psychological thrillers. Every title is made to leave a mark — twisted plots, non-Earth worlds, and unforgettable characters. If you love stories that live rent-free in readers’ heads, you’re in the right place.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">• Product description:&nbsp;</span></u></strong></p><p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1282\" id=\"isPasted\"><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">We sell digital downloadable books — think TV-show energy, but written to grip you from page one. Our stories are original IPs.</span></p><p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1282\"><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Genres include:</span></p><ul data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1486\"><li data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1340\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1340\">Dark Fantasy Romance (<em data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1322\"><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">Synthetic </span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">Fire, The Hallow Crown, Tears of divine)</span></em></p></li><li data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1384\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1384\">Reality-warped&nbsp;mysteries (<em data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1381\"><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">Unscripted, Soulkeeper of Tikum</span></em>)</p></li><li data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1434\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1434\">Dark&nbsp;psychological&nbsp;horror (<em data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1431\"><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">City </span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">of </span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">Shadows</span></em>)</p></li><li data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1486\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1486\">And more in the pipeline, launching every 2 weeks</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong><u><br></u></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1670\" id=\"isPasted\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1670\">📚 <span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">100%&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">original&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">stories</span> from an emerging creative universe</p></li><li data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1728\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1728\">💻 <span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">Digital =&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">no&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">shipping</span>,&nbsp;no&nbsp;delays,&nbsp;no&nbsp;inventory</p></li><li data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1793\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1793\">🔁 <span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">New&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">releases&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">every&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">2&nbsp;</span><span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\">weeks</span> = fresh content to promote</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong><br></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">• Payment terms:</span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2108\" id=\"isPasted\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2108\">Earn 44% base commission on every sale</p></li><li data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2163\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2163\">+5% bonus on select titles (All Our Bundles)</p></li><li data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2204\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2204\">Payouts are automatic via PayPal</p></li><li data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2267\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2267\">Bank transfer and debit payouts available</p></li><li data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2333\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2333\">No minimum follower count — performance matters more than clout</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">• Other information: <span class=\"_fadeIn_m1hgl_8\" id=\"isPasted\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2529\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2529\">We provide ready-made promo assets (The Books)</p></li><li data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2653\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2653\">Creators&nbsp;who&nbsp;bring&nbsp;in&nbsp;consistent&nbsp;sales&nbsp;may&nbsp;get&nbsp;early access to unreleased books,&nbsp;custom&nbsp;requests,&nbsp;or&nbsp;future&nbsp;collabs</p></li><li data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2698\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2698\">Our&nbsp;tone:&nbsp;edgy,&nbsp;stylish,&nbsp;emotionally&nbsp;raw</p></li><li data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2796\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2796\">ALL platforms welcome:</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
